# 6. BACKGROUND CLASSIFICATION

Character Background menentukan apakah karakter mendapatkan Family Name.

```text
BACKGROUND
│
├── Commoner
├── Farmer
├── Worker
├── Merchant
├── Craftsman
├── Soldier
├── Adventurer
├── Mage
├── Priest
├── Noble
├── Aristocrat
├── Royal
└── Imperial
```

Rule:

```text
Commoner
    ↓
No Noble Family

Merchant
    ↓
Normally No Noble Family

Soldier
    ↓
Normally No Noble Family

Noble
    ↓
Family RNG

Royal
    ↓
Royal Family RNG

Imperial
    ↓
Imperial Family RNG
```

---

# 7. FAMILY GENERATION RULE

Family generation hanya dilakukan jika:

```text
Background = Noble
OR
Background = Royal
OR
Background = Imperial
```

Contoh:

```text
Race
 ↓
Human
 ↓
Background
 ↓
Noble
 ↓
Family RNG
 ↓
Ravencrest
```

Hasil:

```text
Kael Ravencrest
```

