# 31. FAMILY NAME GENERATION RULE

Family Name tidak di-RNG secara universal.

Gunakan:

```text
Race
+
Background
+
Region
+
House Rank
```

Contoh:

```text
Human
+
Noble
+
Northern Kingdom
+
Duke
```

menghasilkan pool:

```text
Frostvale
Wintermere
Northmere
Ravencrest
Stormvale
```

Sedangkan:

```text
High Elf
+
Noble
+
Ancient Forest
+
Grand Duke
```

menghasilkan:

```text
Aeltharion
Elendris
Sylvarion
Vaelorian
Caelvane
```

---

# 32. FAMILY NAME DOES NOT DETERMINE POWER

Family Name tidak otomatis menentukan combat power.

Contoh:

```text
Ravencrest
```

tidak berarti semua karakter Ravencrest kuat.

Power tetap ditentukan oleh:

```text
Level
Star
Class
Stats
Skills
Equipment
Traits
Talent
Experience
```

Family hanya mempengaruhi:

```text
Background
Social Status
Bloodline
Relationships
Political Connections
Potential Traits
```

