# 36. CORE RULES

```text
RULE 01
Every character must have a unique Character_ID.

RULE 02
Family_ID represents the actual family entity.

RULE 03
Family Name may be duplicated.

RULE 04
Character with Commoner background does not receive Noble Family.

RULE 05
Noble characters use Race-based Family RNG.

RULE 06
Royal characters use Royal Family RNG.

RULE 07
Imperial characters use Imperial Family RNG.

RULE 08
One Family_ID may contain multiple characters.

RULE 09
Family Name does not determine combat power.

RULE 10
Family system may later connect to Bloodline,
Inheritance, Marriage, Politics, Territory,
and Royal Succession.
```

---

# 37. SYSTEM CONNECTION

Character Family System terhubung dengan:

```text
Character System
        │
        ├── Race System
        ├── Gender System
        ├── Background System
        ├── Class System
        ├── Trait System
        ├── Talent System
        │
        ↓
Family System
        │
        ├── Noble House
        ├── Royal House
        ├── Bloodline
        ├── Family Tree
        ├── Reputation
        └── Political Relationship
```

Dengan struktur ini, **Family Name bukan sekadar nama tambahan**, tetapi menjadi entity yang bisa digunakan game untuk membangun **Noble House, Royal Family, Bloodline, hubungan antar-karakter, dan perkembangan dunia** di kemudian hari.
